/Producer (pypdf)
/Title (PyCon DE \046 PyData 2026 \055 Certificate of Attendance for Esperanza Buitrago D\355az)
/Subject (Built by the community\054 for the community\056 PyCon DE \046 PyData is organized entirely by volunteers\204experts\054 developers\054 data scientists\054 AI engineers\054 and thoughtful executives shaping the field\204who give their time because they believe in open knowledge sharing and an inclusive\054 diverse community\056 This isn\220t just a great program\056 It\220s a meeting point for deep experience and real thought leadership\204where hard\055won lessons\054 bold ideas\054 and emerging practices get shared early\054 tested in conversation\054 and turned into what comes next\056 Every talk is selected by peers who know the field\204so you get real insights\054 honest lessons learned\054 and practical takeaways beyond the slide hype\056 Every decision puts your experience over profit\056 That\220s why the impact goes far beyond the stage\204and why the quality stays this high\056\012)
/Author (Python Softwareverband e\056V\056)
/Keywords (EuroSciPy\054 Python Softwareverband e\056V\056\054 Python\054 Conference\054 Certificate\054 Attendance)
/Creator (py\055pdf\057fpdf2\0568\0563 with pypdf\057reportlab)
